# M9 gate-set oracle baseline — frozen 2026-07-02
# Source: loopzero-ops quality --list | sort (MA-1, MEET-2026-07-02-001)
# Contract: M9 steps 4 & 7 MUST diff their post-change --list against this byte-for-byte.
# Split at freeze: registered=70 wired=30 unwired=40
# NAME<TAB>WIRED<TAB>SUMMARY
acyclic-graph	wired	Enforces the decomposition DAG (loopzero-contracts ◄── engine/cloud/cli); no import cycle.
advisory-lock-scope	wired	Forbids session-scoped pg_advisory_lock; only pg_advisory_xact_lock is allowed.
agpl-isolation	unwired	Verifies AGPL-licensed code stays isolated from proprietary import paths.
alert-runbooks	unwired	Every Prometheus alert has a linked runbook annotation.
anonymous-auth	wired	Forbids anonymous/unauthenticated access on protected API surfaces.
base-image-digest	unwired	Base images are pinned by digest, not floating tags.
baseline-compare	unwired	Compares a captured steady-state baseline against the current state.
baseline-update	unwired	Updates the committed steady-state baseline artifact.
caddyfile-csp	wired	Operator-local edge Caddyfile invariants (no CSP on app-dev, preserved headers, rate-limit).
cli-bundle-size	unwired	Guards the CLI published bundle size against regression.
cli-exit-codes	wired	Enforces the permanent CLI exit-code contract (0/1/2/3/4/5 only).
clusterimagepolicy-mode	unwired	Validates the sigstore ClusterImagePolicy enforcement mode.
cluster-role-no-secrets-star	wired	Forbids unconditional cluster-wide secrets/configmaps RBAC grants.
contract-consumers	unwired	Verifies cross-repo contract consumers stay in sync with the contract.
corrections-txt-closed	wired	Asserts CORRECTIONS.txt items are all closed.
correlation-header	wired	Correlation-ID header is forwarded across the request path.
cosign-cutover	unwired	Enforces the cosign keyed→keyless cutover deadline ratchet.
coverage-diff	unwired	Diffs test coverage against a baseline to catch regressions.
coverage-merge	unwired	Merges per-package coverage profiles into one report.
crd-semantic-diff	unwired	Semantic diff of CRD schemas to catch breaking spec changes.
dangling-data-refs	wired	Detects data/file references that no longer resolve after a change.
dangling-script-refs	wired	Detects shell-script references that no longer resolve after a change.
dashboard-promtool	wired	Validates Grafana dashboard + Prometheus rules via promtool.
decisions-deletion	unwired	Guards deletion of decision/ADR records.
divergence-matrix	unwired	Checks the local-vs-prod divergence matrix is current.
dockerfile-no-docker-hub	wired	Forbids unqualified docker.io/Docker Hub base images.
drill-creds-isolation	unwired	Ensures DR-drill credentials are isolated from production.
drill-outputs-consumers	unwired	Verifies drill Pulumi-output consumers use the canonical schema.
git-diff-to-lines	unwired	Utility: converts a git diff into a changed-line set for other gates.
helm-diff-structural	unwired	Structural pre-sync Helm diff to catch drift before apply.
helm-drift	unwired	Detects drift between rendered Helm charts and the deployed state.
helm-overlap-parity	wired	Keeps the dual Helm chart systems (infra/helm vs charts) in parity.
migration-test-coverage	unwired	Every DB migration has corresponding test coverage.
mock-budget	unwired	Caps the number of mocks per test (SRP smell budget).
no-aes-remaining	wired	Calendar-gated: fails on remaining AES code paths post-transit migration.
no-env-vault-secrets	wired	Forbids secrets-as-env-var regression after the ESO/OpenBao migration.
no-legacy-sa-token-secret	wired	Forbids legacy kubernetes.io/service-account-token Secrets.
no-migrate-force	unwired	Forbids forced/destructive DB migration operations.
no-new-bash	wired	Blocks new .sh files not in the shell-scripts allowlist.
no-pulumi-inline-secrets	unwired	Forbids inline secret literals in Pulumi code.
no-shell-wrap	unwired	Forbids thin shell wrappers around pure-logic that belongs in Go.
orphan-alerts	unwired	Detects Prometheus alerts with no owning dashboard/runbook.
pkg-usage-matrix	unwired	Verifies the pkg/ cross-component usage matrix is current.
postgresql-pdb-config	wired	Validates the PostgreSQL PodDisruptionBudget configuration.
prod-image-digests	wired	Production manifests reference images by digest.
prod-image-tags	unwired	Forbids mutable :latest-style image tags in production manifests.
quarantine-protect	wired	Protects the canonical-tests-v1 quarantine from accidental edits.
regression-matrix	wired	Verifies the regression-test matrix covers required scenarios.
regression-test	unwired	Asserts a regression test exists for tracked fixed bugs.
runtime-slo	unwired	Validates runtime SLO definitions and thresholds.
script-count	wired	Tracks the total shell-script count against the reduction target.
scripts-audit	unwired	Audits shell scripts against the allowlist ledger.
security-context	unwired	Enforces pod securityContext (non-root, limits, probes).
service-auth-rotation	unwired	Enforces the Ed25519 service-auth key rotation cadence.
shell-hygiene	wired	Lints shell scripts for strict-mode and hygiene rules.
skip-link	unwired	Verifies accessibility skip-link presence in the dashboard.
spotcheck-dimension	unwired	Spot-checks a maturity-audit dimension against evidence.
sqlc-sync	wired	Committed sqlc generated/ is in sync with the schema codegen.
sqlc-tx-prop	wired	Enforces pool-bound vs tx-bound query propagation inside withEnvironmentLock.
stack-coverage	unwired	Verifies the tool-inventory stack-coverage claims via grep.
taskfile-interface	unwired	Validates the Taskfile public-interface contract.
template-compliance	unwired	Checks documents comply with their canonical templates.
tenant-predicate	wired	Enforces the multi-tenant isolation predicate (security veto-backed).
test-deletion	unwired	Guards deletion of test files against coverage loss.
test-pyramid	unwired	Validates the unit/integration/e2e test-pyramid balance.
test-targets	unwired	Verifies Taskfile test targets exist and are wired.
transit-coverage	wired	Enforces the OpenBao transit dispatcher invariant (encrypt/decrypt-for-store).
trivy-scan	wired	Runs Trivy CVE scanning on filesystem/images.
trufflehog-scan	wired	Runs TruffleHog verified-secret scanning.
unhomed-logic	wired	Forbids un-homed operational logic that belongs in a pkg/quality gate.
